7（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 已完成的交付\\n\\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\\n\\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\\n   - 错误：timeout\\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\\n\\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1,\n      \"endLine\": 31,\n      \"score\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7684100759536899,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\\n\\n## 发送状态：失败\\n\\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\\n\\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n\\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \\\"missing scope: operator.write\\\"（P0，regression）\\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f","path":"memory/OPENCL