{"type":"message","id":"4aa6eca5","parentId":"f3817b9b","timestamp":"2026-04-01T21:03:55.022Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_J3C5E59l34pk0Ma7scG4oZP3|fc_0d563d798a295fa90169cd883810448191a46e42bf6a515617","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues openclaw-weixin issue\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 2090,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e54f45478339952\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: · Issue #18020 · openclaw/openclaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1e54f45478339952\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/18020\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30dc1700daf143c4\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe Feishu plugin likely received an update that depends on this newer function, but your gateway hasn't been updated to match. After upgrading,\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"30dc1700daf143c4\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99998224\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a3d2406cf407ca9\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nExternal openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14 ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"5a3d2406cf407ca9\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/52341\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"119029668cf96395\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# [Bug]: External openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14 #52341. [[Bug]: External openclaw-weixin plugin fails to load on 2026.3.14](#top)#52341. After installing `@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin@1.0.2` into a local OpenClaw `2026.3.14` source checkout on macOS 26.2, the Weixin plugin does not load consistently: gateway startup logs `Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk'` or `Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk/core'`, and CLI plugin loading logs `TypeError: (0 , _pluginSdk.resolvePreferredOpenClawTmpDir) is not a function`. 5. Observe plugin load failures instead of a stable running Weixin channel. After installation and QR login, the external Weixin plugin should load under both gateway startup and CLI/plugin-registry loading, and `channels status` should show a running Weixin account without plugin load errors. * `Error: Cannot find module 'openclaw/plugin-sdk'`. Related existing issue: #52153 is about proactive sending on Weixin; this report is about plugin loading / SDK compatibility before normal runtime behavior. Affected: local/source OpenClaw installs using the external `@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin` plugin. Consequence: The Weixin plugin does not load reliably, so the channel cannot be used normally.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"119029668cf96395\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99991655\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7ac777aaa1dc8bdb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: openclaw channels login error · Issue #7885\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7ac777aaa1dc8bdb\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/7885\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1c7b0738a2febec5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nreport errors: OpenClaw 2026.2.1 (ed4529e) — Turning \\\"I'll reply later\\\" into \\\"my bot replied instantly\\\". Waiting for WhatsApp\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"1c7b0738a2febec5\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99991107\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6584f4617db2a9f2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: Error running `openclaw plugins install ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6584f4617db2a9f2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https