ype.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"02377d68950223fb\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9984269\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"41d67020907d9efd\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Feature]: WeChat channel setup for Moltbot · Issue #3694\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"41d67020907d9efd\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/3694\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e00c1b48472b2240\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw Maintainer Triage // Issue Closure. Hi — this is a joint maintainer effort to keep the repo moving. We're currently seeing ~30 new\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e00c1b48472b2240\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9984022\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ddd0410950359f5\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPlugins incompatible with OpenClaw 2026.1.30 - Missing \\\" ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ddd0410950359f5\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/5553\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4c6e87cf7d77addb\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBug Report After updating OpenClaw to version 2026.1.30, from a setup on the version 2026.1.29 all plugins fail to install with the same\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4c6e87cf7d77addb\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9980732\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues openclaw-weixin issue","provider":"tavily","count":10,"tookMs":2090,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"tavily","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1e54f45478339952\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[Bug]: · Issue #18020 · openclaw/openclaw\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1e54f45478339952\">>>","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/18020","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_U