es, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. # [Bug] Feishu health-check restarts can clear pending mention history context #39488. [[Bug] Feishu health-check restarts can clear pending mention history context](#top)#39488. In Feishu mention-gated group chats (`requireMention=true`), pre-mention history can be missing on the trigger turn after channel auto-restarts. health monitor restart -> in-memory pending history cleared -> mention-trigger context injection incomplete. * `gateway.channelHealthCheckMinutes=0` -> issue stopped reproducing in local tests. * `gateway.channelHealthCheckMinutes=5` (default) -> issue reproduced again. 2. Mention bot with a trigger message. Mention-trigger turn should consistently receive full pending pre-mention history (within configured limit), regardless of monitor cycles. After channel restart events, pending in-memory history can be cleared before trigger turn consumes it. It may coexist with other ordering/concurrency issues, but this restart path is independently reproducible. No fields configured for issues without a type. ## Issue actions.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"51a6e8caf8e8ad0c\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.96741027\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f21a1fb4375ff28d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPrompt-cache not used because OpenClaw is changing ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f21a1fb4375ff28d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/45110\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"02a7410ca4ff28b8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nMar 13 14:32:05 llama-server.sh[150217]: slot update_slots: id 1 | task 20766 | restored context checkpoint (pos_min = 65535, pos_max = 65535, n_tokens = 65536, n_past = 65536, size = 75.376 MiB) Mar 13 14:32:05 llama-server.sh[150217]: slot up