/39185) | Mar 7 | Heartbeat subsystem ignores HEARTBEAT.md |. | [#41879](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/41879) | Mar 10 | isHeartbeatEnabledForAgent ignores agents.defaults.heartbeat |. | [#42495](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/42495) | Mar 11 | Heartbeat polls overwrite session displayName |. | [#43728](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/43728) | Mar 12 | Heartbeat config written to invalid location |. | [#45422](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/45422) | Mar 13 | heartbeat.model configuration not working |. | [#45772](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/45772) | Mar 14 | Gateway Heartbeat timer stops (this issue) |. The lossless-claw context engine registration timing bug ([#40232](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/40232)) may be causing heartbeat scheduler to fail:. 3.   **Investigate lossless-claw context engine registration timing** ([Plugin context engines can resolve before plugin registration (Lossless Claw / contextEngine slot)#40232](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/40232)) — may be related to heartbeat scheduler failure. *   [fix: guarantee heartbeat timer re-arm with try/finally #52270](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/pull/52270). [fix: wrap heartbeat run() in try/finally to guarantee timer re-arm](https://github.com/MiloStack/openclaw/commit/65f15710c23ed2b071a74750411f82a46833aaeb). [fix: wrap heartbeat run() in try/finally to guarantee timer re-arm](https://github.com/MiloStack/openclaw/commit/379e6a9cdd6dd454642dd3371f604a781de29ebd). [fix: wrap heartbeat run() in try/finally to guarantee timer re-arm](https://github.com/MiloStack/openclaw/commit/b83efd4a8a67f3100652a91ee6a0db3e84e141ea).\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9449a7c06171c508\">>>","score":0.9923044},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9f7eda920673cede\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[Bug] Feishu health-check restarts can clear pending ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"9f7eda920673cede\">>>","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/39489/linked_closing_reference?reference_location=REPO_ISSUES_INDEX","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"51a6e8caf8e8ad0c\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n# Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. You switched accounts on another tab or window. # [Bug] Feishu health-check restarts can clear pending mention history context #39488. [[Bug] Feishu health-check restarts can clear pending mention history context](#top)#39488. In Feishu mention-gated group chats (`requireMention=true`), pre-mention history can be missing on the trigger turn after channel auto-restarts. health monitor restart -> in-memory pending history cleared -> mention-trigger context injection incomplete. * `gateway.channelHealthCheckMinutes=0` -> issue stopped reproducing in local tests. * `gateway.channelHealthCheckMinutes=5` (default) -> issue reproduced again. 2. Mention bot with a trigger message. Mention-trigger turn should consistently receive full pending pre-mention history (within configured limit), regardless of monitor cycles. After channel restart events, pending in-memory history can be cleared before trigger turn consumes it. It may coexist with other ordering/concurrency issues, but this restart path is independently reproducible. No fields configured for issues without a type. ## Issue actions.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"51a6e8caf8e8ad0c\">>>","score":0.96741027},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f21a1fb4375ff28d\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nPrompt-cache not used because OpenClaw is changing ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"f21a1fb4375ff28d\">>>","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/45110","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"02a7410ca4ff28b8\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nMar 13 14:32:05 llama-server.sh[150217]: slot update_slots: id 1 | task 20766 | res