{"type":"message","id":"2ddbb0a6","parentId":"6d51e3f6","timestamp":"2026-04-01T21:04:08.883Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Exploring web search reliability**\n\nI'm noticing that web searches can be unreliable for recent information. So, I'm considering using a browser on a GitHub page to access the rendered DOM and search through the visible content. It seems like a practical solution! I think I’m going to open the issue search page in the browser and take a snapshot. Let’s see if that helps in gathering more accurate data!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d563d798a295fa90169cd8845762c81918d8f5f35983d6539\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpzYhIy87C6HGUnk7tuR1Up5Q7h6k6P8xUU8qZLu19qbRMojD5ycBwcAmD0eCgAs5yzUiKGij8ku6vMdVDzXAL5fXGafYUpTCh_fKnWgJf-9Ph8WLymrdK8NaJzrKgqJF-5zdGroNXxgFvLpUGt-jROcx7Klc-Dd0dLwtO8AOf-IeDl0u8o9FQUxN0_oFcX7f6k6_M1Ugcf5rx6EcQ0t3JDWhD7VXyDsqcxMPDnEwsV7QUybTs-gXAFx7XilaHQI9cP8RNJL4aimsu0XcoOukyoBHUIxM63Dmf10VTsU7NyZT_XR7J7XTsZVdPuRXR8SRRf4pW6LB3YngiBxiETYDJV-asE3RJuDFai7EE3iHxYcoa93w4kOP7EY0nzHoBtSomTG3nrFX4X3KiZ6L5qgzoHMv9a3FVL0e6ohCqjIc7Vl9LiPtq8nLqqXTPg-LYVFloImCBggsrKT5WUN5HyGH9Dn4Bxr7Ue00gRGeELhv72U-5d1mKNEWxbGBt6W1V_BqLPEWdrzmw1fzc95VmDl9QB39hqD8uzIbc4QFTLD3eci_Y1rKlWcVyC9yBipsqH41Gwe4idppcnNI3xXidu1RDU4Bs0n4LRJx8XLxiT6JJamm-6BDhqdj14IWpMckhAr6j8rlIfKmhawIgwOGhXlE7ZTSCCCekdXNc_SsEF3VTmneP9bwxoLegXiG_ZGdqGgJN_Gh6eoVXQ_5Er72X6YnbiekskV-5PB5M0OKceF8pZx2_7DxgRpAuXoMYVbRu3kXDujxXtu7kwakGj0DI_rDOJrKZZPz_Sg01WOdcgMP1t9c2siphhBkXU9xMTVfUeGFyNjg1g54o_gDxbOC2J9QhJahjqTTIysJPu1MwG2AS4XaoXI9bPiaHIeoNcgVK1u4oeTh-EAv8YzR73mIg91_uWh6iOYP53O70-LQUh4LG27qfwjU38dASw7KRFjNdZ6PC5YtI0hH-qOup9qjbV0HifQQcS6Pgc1SpHpYIaiRLKzjMw58P-1-OkOd_a-AIwz8pvZg1P1EemUWlBEOhTJnaJmcEMxAsXU_3gxerDzku5H82tNw=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Exploring web search reliability**\\n\\nI'm noticing that web searches can be unreliable for recent information. So, I'm considering using a browser on 