99,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\\n\\n## 发送状态：失败\\n\\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\\n\\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n\\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \\\"missing scope: operator.write\\\"（P0，regression）\\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"915dcd2750ee651f6c9b71eebf63afc58157b6ee5cb536bb1a3ec99368504290\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1892,\n      \"endLine\": 1897,\n      \"score\": 0.7658555421798765,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7658555421798765,\n      \"snippet\": \"| 57132 | bug+regression | sglang failed to load from /app/extensions/sglang/index.ts: RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded | P0 | 未覆盖 | docker 安装时 sglang provider 加载失败，Maximum call stack size exceeded |\\n| 57144 | bug | LaunchAgent plist loses custom env vars on npm global update | {级 | 未覆盖 | npm global update 时 LaunchAgent plist 被重新生成，用户自定义的环境变量没有保留，Gateway 启动失败 |\\n| 57063 | regression+性能问题 | [Regression] v2026.3.28 inverts model fallback logic and leaks session modelOverrides, causing massive latency | P0 | 未覆盖 | 模型回退逻辑被反转，session modelOverrides 泄漏到子/cron 会话，导致 massive latency（59-second wait，lane congestion） |\\n| 57026 | 基础设施问题 | [infra] OLLAMA_API_KEY missing — Gateway startup block\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6abdf1dc2ed2c1c0edefb8f86c2b7bcfc6703c384b2bea4cb2acbdff7c41948a\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1041,\n      \"endLine\": 1055,\n      \"score\": 0.7576843755082747,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7576843755082747,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **root cause**：调用者提供的工具与内置工具同名时，会完全覆盖内置行为（纯名称匹配，无警告、无日志、无指示）\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Built-in bypass / denial of capability：调用者可以通过注册同名 stub 来禁用任何服务器端内置工具\\n  2. Multi-tenant shadowing：在共享或多用户 gateway 部署中，用户可以 shadow 内置工具\\n  3. Unpredictable agent behavior：agent 无法区分 tool 是本地执行还是被委托\\n- **可修性**：S（有明确的修复建议：Option 1 prefix injection，Option 2 reject on conflict，Option 3 namespace enforcement）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\\n- **修复建议**：推荐 Option 1（prefix injection）- 当 caller-provided tool name 与内置名冲突时，自动重命名 caller 的工具为 `caller_XXX`\\n\\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\\n\\n**#57243** - [Bug]: macOS companion app node host (openclaw-node) always connects to 127.0.0.1:18789 in remote mode, ignoring gateway.remote.url\\n- **类型**：bug +\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"55537203f6dc0618f3a01b8ffb5fc8359dfedd7b90699e53179709fdaeebb5d6\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 972,\n      \"endLine\": 991,\n      \"score\": 0.7551139672444702,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7551139672444702,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Ineffective mark-compacts near heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\\n\\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\\n\\n**#57333** - [Bug] Webchat messages routed to subagent session instead of main session\\n- **类型**：bug + routing\\n- **严重度**：高（消息路由错误，用户困惑）\\n- **root cause**：Webchat 消息被路由到活跃的 subagent session 而不是 main session，用户没有回复特定消息，而是发送 fresh messages\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Main session 看起来无响应（等待用户输入 ~10 分钟）\\n  2. 消息进入错误的会话上下文（subagent 处理了本应由 orchestrator 处理的请求）\\n  3. 用户认为系统卡住\\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 webchat 的 routing 逻辑，确保新消息总是路由到 main session；subagent 只应接收 internal task prompts, completion events, explicit sessions_send）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#57306** - sessions_spawn model param\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"629d4f35d1f07df49528984c62d9d102c5b2e2a7caa7ecae010219b8fcee24c0\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 989,\n      \"endLine\": 1006,\n      \"score\": 0.7475063280807774,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7475063280807774,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **严重度**：高（sessions_spawn model 参数完全失效）\\n- **root cause**：当 sessions_spawn 使用 model 参数时，subagent 不在请求的模型上启动，而是启动在 fallback 模型，然后检测到模型不匹配并尝试 live session model switch，切换失败抛出 LiveSessionModelSwitchError\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. 完全阻止在指定模型上启动 subagent\\n  2. sessions_spawn 的 model 参数非功能（总是启动在 fallback 模型）\\n  3. Subagent 立即死亡（0 tokens generated）\\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 sessions_spawn 的模型参数处理逻辑，让它设置 initial model 而不是触发生模型切换）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **log snippet**：`[agent/embedded] live session model switch detected before attempt for <session>: anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6 -> anthropic/claude-opus-4-6`\\n\\n**#57291** - [Bug]: Gateway crashes with uncaught exception on Discord WebSocket stale-socket reconnect (code 1005)\\n- **\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L989-L1006\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L989-L1006\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":21,"endLine":42,"score":0.8384338811075842,"textScore":0.83843388110