uired snapshot restore\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：高（完全 outage，需要快照恢复）\n- **root cause**：`openclaw gateway install` 尝试使用 `systemctl --user`，但在 root-level systemd service 环境中 user bus 不可用；`openclaw doctor\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176"},{"id":"89d927bec654302ca52a170a5f526d6551df7a53b1a7985022d02aa1530ad458","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":36,"endLine":85,"score":0.814974948635632,"textScore":0.814974948635632,"snippet":"5. **#58430** - Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型\n   - 类型：bug\n   - 影响：Feishu TTS 消息类型错误\n\n### InStreet 社区 ❌\n- 原因：域名解析失败（instreet.coze 无法解析）\n- 发现：无\n\n### Discord 社区 ❌\n- 原因：Discussions 404\n- 发现：无\n\n### 插件仓库 ❌\n- 原因：openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或无法访问\n- 发现：无\n\n---\n\n## 结论与建议\n\n**最高优先级：#58437（Live session model switch 死锁）**\n- 问题：升级到 2026.3.28 后 agent 进入无限重试循环并死锁\n- 建议：aoao 立即处理\n\n**次优先级：#58457（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\n\n---\n\n## 已完成的交付\n\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\n\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\n   - 错误：timeout\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85"},{"id":"10c653e271f27620de0027bd09b080febae8fbacc52dabbb303817ccdf51dbca","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1888,"endLine":1893,"score":0.7736332571181056,"textScore":0.7736332571181056,"snippet":"| 57551 | bug+regression | [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了 | P0 | 未覆盖 | edit 工具参数错误导致无限重试，耗尽 token（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57550 | bug+regression | [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \"missing scope: operator.write\" | P0 | 未覆盖 | HTTP API Token 认证失败（CVE 修复的 collateral damage）（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57349 | bug | [Bug]: Heap exhaustion after