Context":{"channel":"webchat"},"updatedAt":1775025395805,"sessionId":"39f0e235-c51e-49d9-a9d0-e01ca000a070","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":19471,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"done","startedAt":1775023566045,"endedAt":1775025395034,"runtimeMs":23435,"abortedLastRun":false,"lastChannel":"webchat","transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/39f0e235-c51e-49d9-a9d0-e01ca000a070.jsonl","messages":[{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The exec command was denied because the approval timed out. The user needs to approve the command again."},{"type":"text","text":"<final>\n命令未执行，原因是审批超时（Approval timeout）。\n\n`gh api` 这类外部命令需要你手动在终端点击**同意**才能运行，超时未操作就会自动拒绝。\n\n请重新触发任务，或者你直接在终端里手动运行这几条命令：\n\n```sh\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54952/comments --jq 'length'\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/54964/comments --jq 'length'\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55008/comments --jq 'length'\ngh api repos/openclaw/openclaw/issues/55013/comments --jq 'length'\n```\n\n把结果发回来就行。\n</final>"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":59,"output":161,"totalTokens":19632,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":19412,"cost":{"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775025382153,"responseId":"061befe6ace2560f914a5a21a548fafb","__openclaw":{"id":"9d8be7be","seq":6}}]},{"key":"agent:main:cron:348ae583-55fc-4ba5-8208-d2cb795a943c","kind":"other","channel":"unknown","label":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","displayName":"Cron: OpenClaw 项目进展日报","updatedAt":1775007367485,"sessionId":"c6993dae-3ad8-4b53-a0b8-52c66e4fe731","model":"deepseek-v3.2","contextTokens":200000,"totalTokens":66613,"estimatedCostUsd":0,"status":"running","startedAt":1774746398971,"systemSent":true,"abortedLastRun":false,"transcriptPath":"/root/.openclaw/agents/main/sessions/c6993dae-3ad8-4b53-a0b8-52c66e4fe731.jsonl","messages":[]},{"key":"agent:main:subagent:ee05d3ae-111d-4e2e-8ecd-af6ffbe855f0","kind":"other","channel